stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> discover
    discover --> qualify: identity and source reviewed
    discover --> waiting: identity unresolved
    qualify --> recruit: reviewer approves credentials and specialty
    qualify --> waiting: review incomplete
    qualify --> declined: reviewer rejects
    recruit --> onboard: interest and consent recorded
    recruit --> waiting: response or consent pending
    recruit --> declined: expert declines
    onboard --> match: agreement, conflicts, orientation, availability recorded
    onboard --> waiting: prerequisite missing
    match --> review: approved task matches specialty and capacity
    match --> waiting: match or brief unresolved
    review --> learn: human accepts submission
    review --> waiting: submission pending or revision requested
    learn --> complete: relationship evidence and next action recorded
    complete --> [*]
    waiting --> [*]
    declined --> [*]
    note right of waiting
      Episode stops without assuming an external action happened.
      New evidence requires a new episode ID and full snapshot.
      Production event adapters and automatic continuation are not installed.
    end note
